Modifications: the C code was translated to Rust by the GigglesDB project.
The data structures and algorithms follow the C sources file by file; the
memory management, error propagation and locale hooks were adapted to Rust.

The SQL layer (src/api/) is translated from src/backend/utils/adt/regexp.c
and parts of src/backend/utils/adt/varlena.c, and the test data under
tests/ and upstream/ comes from src/test/modules/test_regex and
src/test/regress of PostgreSQL 18.6. That code is covered by the PostgreSQL
licence (upstream/COPYRIGHT):

