(postgres@sha256:e3d24f6906d0760bf4da0dae872415391ededefad23fd471c47dc53b0ddf3c42,
initdb --locale=C.UTF-8 --encoding=UTF8): the code point ranges each
[[:class:]] matches, and upper()/lower() of every code point that changes.
